Here is a concise map of `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/TeachersList.vue` for filtering, UI, data flow, and multi-select.

---

## 1. State variables for list filtering / search

| Purpose | Variable | Type / notes | Lines |
|--------|-----------|--------------|-------|
| Raw list from API | `teachers` | `ref([])` | 431 |
| Search text (name/phone) | `searchQ` | `ref('')` | 439 |
| Status filter (API + dropdown) | `filterStatus` | `ref('')` | 440 |
| Subject filter (client-side only) | `filterSubjectId` | `ref('')` | 441 |
| Tab: active vs pending | `tab` | `ref('active')` | 438 |
| Derived list for grid | `filteredTeachers` | `computed` | 869–885 |
| Subject options for filter dropdown | `subjects` | `ref([])` | 432 |
| Subject key mapping (for subject filter) | `subjectIdToKey`, `subjectKeyToId` | `ref({})` | 631–632 |

**Note:** `searchQ` and `filterStatus` are sent to the server in `loadTeachers`. `filterSubjectId` and `tab` are **not** query params; they only affect `filteredTeachers` in the browser.

---

## 2. Filter UI template (exact block)

```19:40:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/TeachersList.vue
    <div class="filter-row" data-guide="teachers-filters">
      <div class="filter-item filter-item-search">
        <label>搜尋（姓名／電話）</label>
        <input v-model="searchQ" placeholder="輸入姓名或電話..." @input="debouncedLoad" />
      </div>
      <div class="filter-item">
        <label>狀態</label>
        <select v-model="filterStatus" @change="loadTeachers">
          <option value="">全部</option>
          <option value="active">Active</option>
          <option value="pending">Pending</option>
          <option value="suspended">Suspended</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="filter-item">
        <label>科目</label>
        <select v-model="filterSubjectId">
          <option value="">全部</option>
          <option v-for="s in subjects" :key="s.id" :value="s.id">{{ s.name }}</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
```

Related UI: tabs that drive which statuses appear in the list (not the same as `filterStatus`):

```9:12:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/TeachersList.vue
      <div class="tabs">
          <button :class="{ active: tab === 'active' }" @click="tab = 'active'">正式老師 (Active)</button>
          <button :class="{ active: tab === 'pending' }" @click="tab = 'pending'">待審核 (Pending) <span v-if="pendingCount > 0" class="badge">{{ pendingCount }}</span></button>
      </div>
```

**There is no `@change` on the subject `<select>`**—changing subject only updates `filterSubjectId` and the computed `filteredTeachers` reruns; it does not call `loadTeachers`.

---

## 3. Filtering logic

**Server-assisted (reload):**

- `debouncedLoad` (300 ms) → `loadTeachers` when the search input fires `@input` (lines 912–916, 22).
- `filterStatus` `@change` → `loadTeachers` (lines 26, 918–941).

**Client-side (computed `filteredTeachers`):**

```869:885:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/TeachersList.vue
const filteredTeachers = computed(() => {
    let list = tab.value === 'active'
      ? teachers.value.filter(t => t.status === 'active')
      : teachers.value.filter(t => t.status === 'pending');

    if (filterSubjectId.value) {
      const filterId = Number(filterSubjectId.value);
      const selectedKey = subjectIdToKey.value[filterId];
      if (selectedKey) {
        list = list.filter((teacher) => teacherSubjectKeys(teacher).includes(selectedKey));
      } else {
        list = list.filter((teacher) => (teacher.subject_ids || []).map(Number).includes(filterId));
      }
    }

    return list;
});
```

Helpers used for subject matching: `teacherSubjectKeys` (646–657), `subjectIdToKey` populated in `loadSubjects` (954–968).

**Display:** The grid iterates `filteredTeachers` (lines 71–72); empty state uses `filteredTeachers.length === 0` (62–64); summary “目前列表” uses `filteredTeachers.length` (56–57).

---

## 4. How teacher data is loaded and displayed

**Fetch:**

```918:941:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/TeachersList.vue
const loadTeachers = async () => {
  loading.value = true;
  try {
    const params = new URLSearchParams();
    params.set('per_page', 'all');
    if (props.branchId != null) params.set('branch_id', String(props.branchId));
    if (searchQ.value.trim()) params.set('q', searchQ.value.trim());
    if (filterStatus.value) params.set('status', filterStatus.value);
    const headers = await getAuthHeaders();
    const res = await fetch(`${API_BASE}/teachers?${params}`, { headers });
    const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
    const list = Array.isArray(data) ? data : (data?.data ?? []);
    if (!res.ok) {
      alert('載入老師資料失敗：' + (data?.message || res.statusText));
      return;
    }
    teachers.value = list;
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('loadTeachers error:', err);
    alert('載入老師資料時發生錯誤');
  } finally {
    loading.value = false;
  }
};
```

- **Endpoint:** `GET` ``${API_BASE}/teachers`` where `API_BASE = (import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE || '/api') + '/v1'` (lines 426, 927).
- **Auth:** `getAuthHeaders()` uses `supabase.auth.getSession()` and `localStorage.alltrue_session` (903–910).
- **Triggers:** `onMounted` → `loadTeachers()` (1415–1418); `watch(() => props.branchId, ...)` → `loadTeachers()` (1407–1414); after approve/delete/submit flows also call `loadTeachers`.

**Subjects** (for filter dropdown + keys): `loadSubjects` → `GET ${API_BASE}/subjects` (943–979), called on mount (1418).

---

## 5. Multi-select and search elsewhere on this page

**List filters:** Only **single-select** `<select>` for status and subject. Search is a **single text** field (`searchQ`), not a multi-select.

**Multi-select that exists on the page (edit/add modal, not list filter):**

- Cross-branch: `form.multi_branches` with checkboxes (lines 203–216, `v-model="form.multi_branches"`).
- Subjects in form: `form.subject_ids` with checkboxes (lines 238–250).
- Scope table: per-cell checkboxes via `toggleScope` (254–277).

**Bulk import:** `bulkInputText` textarea (320–327), not a multi-select UI for the grid.

---

